This library may be freely distributed and may be freely used for 
non-commercial purposes.

For example usage, see the file driver-c.c or the tutorial cdh.ps.
Tests include:

omnibus.c  Omnibus Moments Test for Normality
geary.c    Geary's Test of Normality
extreme.c  Calculate Extreme Normal Deviates
dagstndn.c D'Agostino's D-Statistic Test of Normality
kuiprsvn.c Kuiper V-Statistic Modified to Test Normality
watsonun.c Watson U^2-Statistic Modified to Test Normality
durbins.c  Durbin's Exact Test (Normal Distribution
andrsndn.c Anderson-Darling Statistic Modified to Test Normality
cvmw2n.c   Cramer-Von Mises W^2-Statistic to Test Normality               *
ksn.c      Kolmogorov-Smirnov D-Statistic to Test Normality               *
           Kolmogorov-Smirnov D-Statistic (Lilliefors Critical Values)
chisqn.c   Chi-Square Test of Normality (Equal Probability Classes)
shapiro1.c Shapiro-Wilk W Test of Normality for Small Samples
shapiro2.c Shapiro-Francia W' Test of Normality for Large Samples
shapiroe.c Shapiro-Wilk W Test of Exponentiality
cvmw2e.c   Cramer-Von Mises W^2-Statistic to Test Exponentiality          *
kse.c      Kolmogorov-Smirnov D-Statistic to Test Exponentiality          *
kuiprsve.c Kuiper V-Statistic Modified to Test Exponentiality
watsonue.c Watson U^2-Statistic Modified to Test Exponentiality
andrsnde.c Anderson-Darling Statistic Modified to Test Exponentiality
chisqe.c   Chi-Square Test for Exponentiality(with E.P.C.)
kotz.c     Kotz Separate-Families Test for Lognormality vs. Normality

*  indicates the test statistic is modified
** indicates the test is for normality vs. lognormality
E.P.C. --- Equal Probability Classes

